Douai, city of the UNESCO belfry and Gayant festival, is often
            overlooked by short-term rental investors in favour of Lille or
            Lens. That's precisely what makes it an opportunity: low acquisition
            prices, still-limited Airbnb competition, and steadily growing
            tourist demand. This guide covers everything about Airbnb concierge
            management in Douai in 2026.

## The Douai Airbnb market: an overview

Douai has around 40,000 inhabitants and is located 20 km from Lens,
            30 km from Arras and 40 km from Lille. This central position in the
            Bassin Minier makes it an ideal base for exploring all the UNESCO
            sites in the region.

In 2026, key Airbnb market indicators for Douai are:

- **Average monthly revenue:** €850 for a well-located
              one-bedroom
- **Average occupancy rate:** 67%
- **Average nightly rate:** €60 (outside events)
- **Event night rate:** €90 to €130 (Gayant, RC Lens
              matches 20 km away)

## Drivers of tourist demand in Douai

The Gayant festival (July), the UNESCO belfry, proximity to the
            Louvre-Lens and the Bassin Minier UNESCO site, and steady business
            travel from industrial zones all drive consistent demand for
            short-term accommodation throughout the year.

## Best areas for Airbnb in Douai

The City Centre (belfry, Grand-Place) commands the highest occupancy
            and ratings. The Scarpe riverside adds a 15–20% premium for
            properties with water views. Faubourg d'Arras suits the business
            traveller seeking quiet and easy parking. Sin-le-Noble targets
            logistics and industrial clientele with motorway access.

## Airbnb regulations in Douai

Douai does not yet have city-specific short-term rental restrictions
            as strict as Lille or Paris. National rules apply: 120-day annual
            limit for primary residences, mandatory registration number, tourist
            tax collected automatically by platforms. Welqo handles all
            administrative procedures on your behalf.

